  "brain_first": "“先看是不是固定搭配；不是再看时间、地点、方式、方向关 系。”",
  "sort_order": 1056,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2383
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "空位常位于名词/代词前，或固定搭配中。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2384
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2385
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Preposition 表示词与词之间的关系。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2386
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先看是不是固定搭配；不是再看时间、地点、方式、方向关",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2387
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "系。”",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2388
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 高考语法填空介词往往来自固定语块或基础意义。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2389
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2390
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 把空和前面动词/形容词连起来看：depend __, interested __。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2391
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 查是否为固定搭配。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2392
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 若不是，判断时间/地点/方向/方式。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2393
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 放回整句检查语义。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2394
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2395
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2396
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2397
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· depend on",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2398
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· contribute to",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2399
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· prevent...from",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2400
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· be aware of",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2401
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· be responsible for",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2402
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· at/on/in 时间基础用法",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2403
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 搭配或空间/时间关系明确。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2404
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 不确定时把前后3-4个词当一个语块回忆，而不是孤立猜介词。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2405
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2406
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "They traded extra goods ___ what they needed. trade A for B → for。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2407
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2408
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 按中文“在/对/为”机械翻译。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2409
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只背介词一个词。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2410
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2411
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是否固定搭配？",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2412
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 关系意义成立吗？",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2413
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2414
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2415
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2416
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 介词优先查搭配，再看关系。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2417
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2419
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. depend ___",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2420
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. be interested ___",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2421
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. reason ___ the change",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2422
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. solution ___ the problem",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2423
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 介词题不知道时先查？",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2424
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. on；2. in；3. for；4. to；5. 固定搭配+前后名词/动词关系。",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2425
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF8 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF8”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 87,
      "sourceIndex": 2426
    }
  ],
